const names=['Blue-quilt bed','Linen wardrobe','Family bookcase','Kitchen range','Stone hearth','Supper table','Washstand','Writing desk','Craft bench','Tool rack','Apothecary cabinet','Patient cot','Storage chest','Provision barrel','Cushioned chair','Worn sofa','Woven rug','Potted greenery','Leaded window','Kitchen pantry','Bedside cabinet','Weaving loom','Equipment stand','Music stand'];
const details=[
 ['The quilt is patched with three different blues. A warm brick has been wrapped at the foot of the bed.','The pillowcase has been mended from the inside, so the seam will not scratch.'],['Clean sheets sit above work coats. Lavender is sewn into the little cloth bags.','The oldest blanket has a stitched label: return it even if the owner has moved.'],['Cookbooks, school exercises and a borrowed atlas share the shelves.','Several margins contain careful corrections in a child’s handwriting.'],['The kettle rests on the cool side of the range. Pots hang where a short person can reach them.','A chalk mark shows the safe position of the damper.'],['A banked fire warms the room without swallowing the whole wood basket.','A cracked tile has been set back into the hearth with brass staples.'],['Bowls, bread, a little salt and a jar of flowers make room for one more person.','A chair has been pulled away from the table as though its owner will be back soon.'],['A jug of clean water stands beside soap, a comb and a neatly folded towel.','Someone has written the day of the last water change beneath the basin.'],['Letters are held flat beneath a chipped blue cup. The ink is not quite dry.','A shopping list turns over to reveal a drawing of a house with every window lit.'],['The work is held in a padded vice. Good tools are kept sharp and within reach.','A nearly finished repair waits beside a note: ask before replacing the original part.'],['Saws, chisels and hammers have their outlines painted on the rack.','One empty hook is labelled with the name of the person who borrowed the tool.'],['Dried herbs hang above labelled jars and clean measuring spoons.','The strongest preparations are locked away from the ordinary remedies.'],['The cot has fresh sheets, a water cup and a blanket folded for cold feet.','A small bell lets the patient call for help without having to stand.'],['The chest has strong hinges and a lid that has been repaired rather than replaced.','The lining smells of cedar. Old packing paper has been saved for another journey.'],['The barrel is raised off the floor to keep the provisions dry.','The contents and the refill date are marked on a removable wooden tag.'],['The cushion is worn smooth on one side. The chair still sits squarely on all four feet.','Felt has been tucked under the back leg so it will not scratch the boards.'],['A wool throw lies over the arm of the sofa beside a half-read book.','A tiny wooden toy has rolled into the space beneath the cushions.'],['The rug softens the boards along the route people use most often.','Its darker thread repairs form a second pattern inside the first.'],['A saucer catches the water beneath a healthy plant. Its leaves turn toward the window.','A cutting has been started in a separate jar for a neighbour.'],['The glass is made from small pieces joined with lead. Daylight gathers on the sill.','A folded scrap of paper stops the frame rattling in the wind.'],['Jars, flour and dried fruit are stored above the damp line, with cups on the lower shelf.','The oldest jars have been moved to the front so nothing will be wasted.'],['A candle, a book and a cup sit on the little cabinet. Matches are kept in a dry tin.','A letter has been put away carefully rather than thrown into the fire.'],['A band of new cloth is stretched across the loom. The shuttle is resting between passes.','The pattern repeats an old village design with one deliberately different thread.'],['Straps and buckles are laid out for inspection. The leather has been cleaned and oiled.','A split seam is marked with chalk for the next repair.'],['The music stand holds a page weighted with a smooth river stone.','Breath marks and a pencilled pause matter as much as the notes.']];
